From 2cf55e10166d6a198456121ae8ff283e072ec28b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:57:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 30/54] hw/display/pvg: compute kernels and dispatch

air2spv: air.kernel entries (GLCompute, LocalSizeId from spec constants
1..3), thread/threadgroup/simd builtins, writable textures as storage
images (write_texture, read on read_write), constant texel offsets on
samples, writable-buffer mask, and an entry guard against a push-constant
grid size (dispatchThreads launches partial threadgroups in Metal).
Executor: compute pipelines (type 7 kind 0xb, key 0 = kernel), compute
segments (SetPipelineState/SetBuffers/SetBufferOffset/SetTextures/
SetSamplers/DispatchThreadgroups/DispatchThreads), storage images and
writable buffers written back to guest memory; storage-capable host images.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
